url: https://openaire-hackathon.netlify.app
abstract: >-
  Replication Radar turns the OpenAIRE Graph into a ranked replication queue and
  adds the signals the Graph cannot hold: whether a claim has been independently
  checked (with the verdict, read live from the Science Live nanopublication
  network) and whether the software behind it is reusable (the fair-software.eu
  recommendations plus RSE good-practice signals, computed live from GitHub,
  Software Heritage and Zenodo). It is a static web app and an MCP server for AI
  agents, designed to run alongside the OpenAIRE MCP.
